{"id":"665445","name":"鲜虾饼","author":"飘零817","authorId":"9420512","desc":"","cover":"images/665445/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买这种大虾。","img":"images/665445/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去壳去虾线，用纸巾擦干水，不然起不了胶。","img":"images/665445/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用刀去拍碎。","img":"images/665445/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"剁成泥。","img":"images/665445/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放点盐，摔个十几下。","img":"images/665445/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入胡萝卜丁，葱花，淀粉。","img":"images/665445/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再倒入葱姜蒜水。","img":"images/665445/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀，手上抹点油，捏成饼一样的形状，全程小火煎。","img":"images/665445/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煎至微黄，喜欢吃焦香点的还可以再煎一下。","img":"images/665445/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/665445/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"还可以做虾球。","img":"images/665445/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}